1
00:00:34,604 --> 00:00:36,664
Thunder rips across the sky

2
00:00:36,834 --> 00:00:38,724
Darkness surges like a flood

3
00:00:39,374 --> 00:00:41,264
The ground trembles beneath our feet

4
00:00:41,444 --> 00:00:44,944
The eyes of the world leave nowhere to hide

5
00:00:45,264 --> 00:00:47,404
An unprecedented battlefield

6
00:00:47,724 --> 00:00:49,483
Extends beyond the borders

7
00:00:49,484 --> 00:00:51,484
Cries echo from afar

8
00:00:51,584 --> 00:00:55,203
Like the judgment bell of fate

9
00:00:55,204 --> 00:00:59,324
No one can change me

10
00:01:00,374 --> 00:01:04,004
No one can take me away

11
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:06,184
I will survive

12
00:01:09,254 --> 00:01:11,284
I will survive

13
00:01:12,874 --> 00:01:15,524
Starlight endures in the ashes

14
00:01:15,844 --> 00:01:17,904
Twinkle, twinkle, shining bright

15
00:01:18,194 --> 00:01:23,864
Burning fury that never dies

16
00:01:34,344 --> 00:01:38,224
Flames blaze bright,

17
00:01:39,394 --> 00:01:44,024
Only faith

18
00:01:44,434 --> 00:01:52,634
Illuminates the eternal night

19
00:02:06,470 --> 00:02:06,950
Pocketed.

20
00:02:08,730 --> 00:02:10,310
Tearfully looting the body, huh?

21
00:02:11,700 --> 00:02:14,300
The demon blade of one of the Divine Assembly's top three Class B elites...

22
00:02:14,570 --> 00:02:15,560
If I feed this to it,

23
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:17,390
it should give tons of EXP.

24
00:02:19,270 --> 00:02:21,589
Still, the Artifact Spirit in Nogi's blade

25
00:02:21,590 --> 00:02:23,850
is on par with Li Yixiao's Black Dragon Spear.

26
00:02:24,270 --> 00:02:25,469
Having an Artifact Spirit by your side...

27
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,890
is pretty sweet.

28
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:29,460
Artifact Spirit, oh Artifact Spirit...

29
00:02:29,580 --> 00:02:31,890
when will I, Lu Shu, earn an Artifact Spirit of my own?

30
00:02:33,710 --> 00:02:34,700
What the heck?

31
00:02:36,590 --> 00:02:38,100
This little snake's host is already dead,

32
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,100
yet why is it still thrashing around?

33
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,540
Last gasp of life, huh?

34
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:43,830
Why not just be good fertilizer for the Divine Water...

35
00:02:45,990 --> 00:02:46,450
It turned...

36
00:02:47,050 --> 00:02:47,930
golden?

37
00:02:48,410 --> 00:02:48,800
It's qui...

38
00:02:49,460 --> 00:02:50,210
quieted down?

39
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:59,440
Why did it turn out like this?

40
00:03:00,590 --> 00:03:01,900
It's actually kind of cute.

41
00:03:02,230 --> 00:03:04,500
Do top experts secretly like things like this?

42
00:03:05,396 --> 00:03:05,810
Hold on.

43
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:07,150
If I keep it,

44
00:03:07,340 --> 00:03:08,720
won't Xiaoyu make fun of me?

45
00:03:09,150 --> 00:03:12,100
My tough-guy rating will totally plummet!

46
00:03:21,440 --> 00:03:22,630
Is it trying to...

47
00:03:22,970 --> 00:03:25,230
...form a blood pact with me?

48
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:27,470
Fine, then.

49
00:03:27,820 --> 00:03:28,990
A little blood won't hurt.

50
00:03:30,070 --> 00:03:31,420
As long as it's not asking for money,

51
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:33,190
it proves this little snake is pretty smart.

52
00:03:36,909 --> 00:03:37,500
Wait...

53
00:03:39,050 --> 00:03:40,920
My bond with the Divine Water just grew even closer!

54
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:42,380
Could it be...

55
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,530
...it's become the Artifact Spirit of my Divine Water?

56
00:03:45,690 --> 00:03:46,420
Awesome!

57
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,780
I, Lu Shu, finally have an Artifact Spirit too!

58
00:03:50,290 --> 00:03:51,810
It even does acrobatics?

59
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:57,590
Got quite the bite, too.

60
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,130
Hold on.

61
00:04:00,830 --> 00:04:02,330
Now that I have this little snake,

62
00:04:02,730 --> 00:04:04,380
next time someone comes at me with a magical weapon,

63
00:04:04,670 --> 00:04:06,620
I can put on a sword-swallowing show for them!

64
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:12,070
I really hit the jackpot this time!

65
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,140
Where the heck did I end up?

66
00:04:18,330 --> 00:04:19,660
Is this even still China?

67
00:04:20,140 --> 00:04:20,730
Alright.

68
00:04:21,230 --> 00:04:23,199
Mazes are standard issue for ruins.

69
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:23,960
It's a classic trope.

70
00:04:25,850 --> 00:04:28,130
But we marked every intersection we passed.

71
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,420
We'll find our way out eventually.

72
00:04:34,570 --> 00:04:35,130
Wait, what's this?

73
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,340
We've been down both paths?

74
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:39,090
How is that possible?

75
00:04:39,320 --> 00:04:40,010
Someone's messing with our marks.

76
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:48,350
Someone's catching up to us.

77
00:04:48,570 --> 00:04:50,990
I really don't want to deal with those big organizations right now.

78
00:04:51,090 --> 00:04:52,540
Time to make a run for it!

79
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:54,830
Who's there?

80
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:57,730
A Rogue Cultivator.

81
00:05:01,070 --> 00:05:01,420
Wait...

82
00:05:02,370 --> 00:05:03,020
Who's up ahead?

83
00:05:06,060 --> 00:05:06,809
Great.

84
00:05:06,810 --> 00:05:08,790
So the two big factions just met up.

85
00:05:09,900 --> 00:05:11,450
Changed my clothes and ditched the mask.

86
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:13,100
They shouldn't recognize me, right?

87
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:15,850
What are you doing here?

88
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,669
Get over here, quick!

89
00:05:21,738 --> 00:05:22,392
One of yours?

90
00:05:31,330 --> 00:05:32,450
No Formation Core in the direction they came from.

91
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:33,880
Let's take another path and keep moving.

92
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,010
These tunnels get more confusing the further we go.

93
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,440
Did you find anything?

94
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,050
Nope.

95
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:41,650
I wandered in circles and got lost too.

96
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:46,170
Then you must've noticed the carvings on the wall.

97
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,850
"Regarding these ruins,"

98
00:05:49,060 --> 00:05:50,580
"I have three points to make."

99
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,500
Then spit it out.

100
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,050
Wonder which expert likes playing pranks so much.

101
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,150
Having so much free time inside a labyrinth...

102
00:05:59,450 --> 00:06:02,230
Must be a handsome and caring expert!

103
00:06:03,470 --> 00:06:05,060
It's definitely you, isn't it?

104
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,260
I hear flowing water up ahead.

105
00:06:14,030 --> 00:06:14,530
Hurry, let's go!

106
00:06:14,810 --> 00:06:16,100
Water means the exit can't be far.

107
00:06:19,650 --> 00:06:20,970
Wow, this is pretty huge.

108
00:06:26,450 --> 00:06:27,370
The water...

109
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,380
looks pretty normal.

110
00:06:30,790 --> 00:06:31,530
Should we...

111
00:06:31,620 --> 00:06:32,860
keep following the river from here?

112
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:38,990
Get away!

113
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,360
Get away from me!

114
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:42,750
Help—

115
00:06:43,450 --> 00:06:44,490
Help me!

116
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,250
All of you,

117
00:06:50,890 --> 00:06:52,300
go deal with these bugs right now!

118
00:06:54,050 --> 00:06:54,440
Move it!

119
00:06:58,190 --> 00:06:58,770
Damn it!

120
00:06:59,120 --> 00:06:59,760
Forget about that!

121
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:01,970
Watch my fireball wipe them out!

122
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,260
Take this!

123
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:07,030
Piece of cake.

124
00:07:07,810 --> 00:07:08,510
What?!

125
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:13,999
Get off!

126
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:14,820
Get off me!

127
00:07:16,210 --> 00:07:16,680
Help—

128
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:17,780
Help!

129
00:07:18,420 --> 00:07:19,370
Run!

130
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:28,520
Stop running!

131
00:07:29,780 --> 00:07:31,040
Get back there and kill those bugs!

132
00:07:39,360 --> 00:07:40,170
Now's my chance!

133
00:07:44,460 --> 00:07:46,340
Let me see, once it eats these bugs,

134
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:48,390
how much my Divine Water will level up.

135
00:07:56,300 --> 00:07:58,370
Nothing's changed at all!

136
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:00,080
Why?

137
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:01,859
There are so many materials,

138
00:08:01,860 --> 00:08:04,650
yet I can't upgrade the Divine Water!

139
00:08:05,830 --> 00:08:07,120
What's the matter with you?

140
00:08:13,610 --> 00:08:15,040
It'd be bad if the elites died here.

141
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:16,710
Wouldn't you

142
00:08:16,910 --> 00:08:17,450
say so?

143
00:08:19,570 --> 00:08:20,580
Break out!

144
00:08:20,790 --> 00:08:21,580
That's great!

145
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:23,130
The major factions are making a move!

146
00:08:25,818 --> 00:08:26,300
Wait, no.

147
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:28,660
Those guys aren't trying to save us at all!

148
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:29,980
They're just running away!

149
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:32,480
Who'd bother saving you?

150
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:33,319
Stay behind, all of you!

151
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:34,109
Li Yixiao!

152
00:08:34,110 --> 00:08:35,259
You bastard!

153
00:08:35,260 --> 00:08:36,910
This is a crime against humanity, Li Yixiao!

154
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,450
You'll face justice once we leave the ruins!

155
00:08:47,230 --> 00:08:48,480
Out of the way, buddy!

156
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:49,929
Shu! Hey, Shu!

157
00:08:49,930 --> 00:08:51,210
Wait for me! Wait up!

158
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:53,919
Like hell I'll wait!

159
00:08:53,920 --> 00:08:55,040
Only an idiot would wait for you!

160
00:08:56,750 --> 00:08:57,579
Come on, don't be like that!

161
00:08:57,580 --> 00:09:00,009
You've gotta help me explain things to the Old Man!

162
00:09:00,010 --> 00:09:01,220
Explain my ass!

163
00:09:01,310 --> 00:09:02,880
How about I light incense at your grave instead?

164
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,340
Reporting!

165
00:09:10,650 --> 00:09:11,540
Nothing found here.

166
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:14,280
What's that sound over there?

167
00:09:16,640 --> 00:09:17,380
Lu Shu, we meet—

168
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,599
Oh, you're here too?

169
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,580
Li Yixiao, get the hell away from me!

170
00:09:25,210 --> 00:09:25,960
What the hell?!

171
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,500
Li Yixiao!

172
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,039
Just wait till the Old Man beats your ass!

173
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:31,689
It really wasn't my fault!

174
00:09:31,690 --> 00:09:33,260
The beetles attacked first!

175
00:09:35,140 --> 00:09:35,729
Who are you kidding?

176
00:09:35,730 --> 00:09:36,560
You're so dead!

177
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,850
Am I really in the ruins?

178
00:09:48,570 --> 00:09:49,580
This feels like...

179
00:09:50,350 --> 00:09:52,140
a marathon.

180
00:09:53,660 --> 00:09:54,460
Good thing...

181
00:09:54,850 --> 00:09:56,250
Xiaoyu didn't come.

182
00:09:57,420 --> 00:09:59,210
She promised to wait outside the palace.

183
00:09:59,570 --> 00:10:00,160
Where's the palace?

184
00:10:00,370 --> 00:10:00,870
Where is she?

185
00:10:02,190 --> 00:10:02,900
Jerk Lu Shu!

186
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,340
Jerk Lu Shu!

187
00:10:07,430 --> 00:10:08,800
It's finally over.

188
00:10:09,730 --> 00:10:10,230
Carol.

189
00:10:10,570 --> 00:10:11,080
Are you all right?

190
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,210
Don't worry.

191
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:13,890
I'm fine.

192
00:10:15,370 --> 00:10:17,510
The paths here are too complicated.

193
00:10:17,950 --> 00:10:19,230
Where should we go next?

194
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:21,890
There's a girl.

195
00:10:23,070 --> 00:10:25,359
Why is there a girl here?

196
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:27,590
I'll go talk to her.

197
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:28,830
What are they saying?

198
00:10:30,200 --> 00:10:30,860
Hello.

199
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,559
What is your name,

200
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:33,450
young lady?

201
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:35,820
May I ask why you are here?

202
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,039
I'm fine.

203
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:40,929
Thank you.

204
00:10:40,930 --> 00:10:41,840
And you?

205
00:10:44,010 --> 00:10:45,880
She says she's fine.

206
00:10:46,770 --> 00:10:47,680
I see.

207
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:49,630
But that's not what we asked.

208
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:52,680
What gibberish are these guys babbling?

209
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:53,700
You!

210
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:56,840
Can you speak Chinese?

211
00:10:57,550 --> 00:10:58,890
What did she just say?

212
00:10:59,230 --> 00:11:01,859
I think she wants us to speak Chinese.

213
00:11:01,860 --> 00:11:03,730
But we don't speak it either.

214
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,179
So annoying!

215
00:11:05,180 --> 00:11:06,700
I told you I don't understand!

216
00:11:12,910 --> 00:11:14,480
What should we...

217
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:16,430
What?

218
00:11:16,940 --> 00:11:17,869
This looks bad.

219
00:11:17,870 --> 00:11:18,550
Time to run!

220
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:20,270
Come with us, quick!

221
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:23,520
Is that...

222
00:11:23,880 --> 00:11:24,570
Carol?

223
00:11:25,010 --> 00:11:26,120
How did you provoke them?!

224
00:11:27,010 --> 00:11:27,370
Shu!

225
00:11:27,490 --> 00:11:28,860
If you really see the Old Man,

226
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,470
you've got to put in a good word for me!

227
00:11:30,830 --> 00:11:32,139
I've finally figured him out...

228
00:11:32,140 --> 00:11:33,139
His attitude toward you and Xiaoyu...

229
00:11:33,140 --> 00:11:34,280
is totally different!

230
00:11:34,740 --> 00:11:36,349
Look behind you before you start talking!

231
00:11:36,350 --> 00:11:38,120
The beetles really attacked first!

232
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,150
Drop dead!

233
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:41,390
How can you be like this?

234
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:43,529
We fought side by side in the Laos ruins!

235
00:11:43,530 --> 00:11:44,440
Drop dead!

236
00:11:44,930 --> 00:11:46,109
You screwed me over last time,

237
00:11:46,110 --> 00:11:47,420
and I haven't even settled the score yet!

238
00:11:47,520 --> 00:11:48,120
Let me tell you...

239
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,159
Let me have some peace!
Drop dead!

240
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:49,399
Drop dead!

241
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:49,429
The back of my head still hurts!
Drop dead!

242
00:11:49,430 --> 00:11:49,879
The back of my head still hurts!

243
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:50,709
Say that again!
The back of my head still hurts!

244
00:11:50,710 --> 00:11:51,119
Say it again!

245
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,249
Die, die, die!

246
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:53,129
I'll bite you to death!

247
00:11:53,130 --> 00:11:53,720
Stop arguing!

248
00:11:53,950 --> 00:11:55,580
Do you hear that rustling sound?

249
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,600
Isn't that the swarm behind us?

250
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:00,609
I don't mean from behind!

251
00:12:00,610 --> 00:12:01,480
It's up ahead!

252
00:12:02,670 --> 00:12:03,060
Wait...

253
00:12:03,410 --> 00:12:04,349
Everyone stop, stop, stop!

254
00:12:04,350 --> 00:12:04,680
Stop!

255
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:06,640
Someone's coming from up ahead!

256
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:09,810
It's you!

257
00:12:11,810 --> 00:12:13,390
I didn't expect to run into you here.

258
00:12:13,930 --> 00:12:14,800
Are you all right?

259
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,759
Hey, sis!

260
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,819
Stop chatting!

261
00:12:17,820 --> 00:12:19,040
We're boxed in!

262
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,040
Then let's fight!

263
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:20,760
No point running anymore!

264
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,340
Screw it!

265
00:12:22,690 --> 00:12:23,479
Grab your weapons, let's go!

266
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:23,840
Got it!

267
00:12:24,230 --> 00:12:25,580
This is trouble.

268
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,560
I need to get her somewhere safe.

269
00:12:27,920 --> 00:12:28,870
If anything happens to her,

270
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:29,920
my money's gone!

271
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:32,900
You're only Class D.

272
00:12:33,210 --> 00:12:34,070
Stay behind me!

273
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:35,630
Okay!

274
00:12:35,980 --> 00:12:36,480
Shu!

275
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:39,420
Damn it!

276
00:12:40,860 --> 00:12:42,600
Take this!

277
00:12:47,210 --> 00:12:49,070
These bugs just never end!

278
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:49,940
Punks!

279
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:51,170
Who are you slashing at?!

280
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:52,860
I slipped!

281
00:12:53,370 --> 00:12:54,350
You did that on purpose!

282
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:56,250
There are way too many bugs!

283
00:12:56,430 --> 00:12:57,610
Just watch your own back!

284
00:13:05,490 --> 00:13:07,950
Feels like the Divine Water's volume has grown a lot.

285
00:13:08,380 --> 00:13:10,080
Could it be...

286
00:13:10,620 --> 00:13:13,390
it ate too little before for me to notice any change?

287
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,029
Damn it.

288
00:13:17,030 --> 00:13:17,760
They're endless!

289
00:13:18,710 --> 00:13:20,020
This swarm is a terrible matchup for me.

290
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,270
Better pull back for now.

291
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,070
Why are there so many people here?

292
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:30,080
And they're all familiar faces.

293
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:32,020
Go help out downstream.

294
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:33,360
As for upstream,

295
00:13:33,810 --> 00:13:35,580
the Phoenix Society can hold it on our own.

296
00:13:37,670 --> 00:13:38,110
Let's go.

297
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,690
Trying to act tough.

298
00:13:40,010 --> 00:13:41,120
Don't blame anyone when you die.

299
00:13:41,460 --> 00:13:43,140
Nobody come over!

300
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,960
I've got this entire area covered!

301
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:47,870
Whoever lifts a finger

302
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:49,340
is looking down on me!

303
00:13:50,330 --> 00:13:50,930
They're all mine!

304
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:51,950
All mine!

305
00:13:52,220 --> 00:13:54,360
They're all mine!

306
00:13:55,690 --> 00:13:58,079
Can someone tell me what's going on?

307
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,500
Maybe it's just an expert's weird quirk.

308
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,090
So are we still killing bugs or not?

309
00:14:02,980 --> 00:14:03,660
I guess so?

310
00:14:03,910 --> 00:14:04,940
They're all...

311
00:14:05,370 --> 00:14:06,400
...mine!

312
00:14:14,810 --> 00:14:16,200
He's actually taunting them!

313
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:18,699
One broken magical weapon...

314
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:19,690
Two broken magical weapons...

315
00:14:20,060 --> 00:14:21,870
Thirty-one broken magical weapons...

316
00:14:23,890 --> 00:14:24,850
Should we chase him?

317
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:25,059
Honestly...

318
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:25,719
All mine, all mine, all mine!
To be honest...

319
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:26,069
All mine, all mine, all mine!

320
00:14:26,070 --> 00:14:27,069
I don't know what to do either.
All mine, all mine, all mine!

321
00:14:27,070 --> 00:14:27,080
All mine, all mine, all mine!

322
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:30,140
I really underestimated how money-grubbing he is.

323
00:14:30,660 --> 00:14:32,080
You two take the others downstream.

324
00:14:32,790 --> 00:14:33,680
I've got things covered here.

325
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:35,810
Better not push yourself too hard.

326
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:36,920
Let's go.

327
00:14:45,050 --> 00:14:46,020
Shook them all off.

328
00:14:47,160 --> 00:14:48,730
The Divine Water has almost finished absorbing them, too.

329
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:49,820
Next up...

330
00:14:52,380 --> 00:14:53,170
A marking?

331
00:14:54,670 --> 00:14:55,719
I didn't make this.

332
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:56,589
Could it be...

333
00:14:56,590 --> 00:14:58,520
A guidepost to the Formation Core?

334
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:00,799
Treasures!

335
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,000
Here I come!

336
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,550
"Xiaoyu was here."

337
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,419
I'm usually the one trolling others.

338
00:15:10,420 --> 00:15:12,089
Never thought this time Xiaoyu would actually...

339
00:15:12,090 --> 00:15:12,850
...manage to pull one over on me.

340
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,640
Whatever.

341
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:18,169
At least it shows Xiaoyu has time to mess around...

342
00:15:18,170 --> 00:15:19,110
...and carve stuff like this for fun.

343
00:15:19,950 --> 00:15:21,610
"Lu Shu is a pig."

344
00:15:23,670 --> 00:15:24,560
There's more?!

345
00:15:24,970 --> 00:15:25,830
Wipe it off, wipe it off!

346
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:27,720
Destroy the evidence!

347
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:29,939
"Lu Shu cried watching TV."

348
00:15:29,940 --> 00:15:31,049
"Lu Shu didn't wash his face for three days."

349
00:15:31,050 --> 00:15:32,070
"Lu Shu is a big dummy."

350
00:15:37,190 --> 00:15:38,030
"Lu Xiaoyu...

351
00:15:38,230 --> 00:15:39,880
...will protect Lu Shu forever."

352
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:09,310
Upstream...

353
00:16:10,090 --> 00:16:11,440
Has something happened already?

354
00:16:19,500 --> 00:16:20,700
Evil sorcery!

355
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:26,140
Go!

356
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:43,380
A blood fiend.

357
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:45,610
Another one?

358
00:16:47,810 --> 00:16:48,160
Wait, no.

359
00:16:49,890 --> 00:16:51,119
The formation in this blood pool

360
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:53,450
can turn gargoyles into Infernal Blood Fiends.

361
00:17:04,430 --> 00:17:05,070
What?

362
00:17:06,220 --> 00:17:06,760
Is this...

363
00:17:08,410 --> 00:17:09,280
a blood sacrifice?

364
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:13,320
Compelling Class B beings to sacrifice themselves...

365
00:17:13,890 --> 00:17:15,460
Then whatever's in that stone coffin must be...

366
00:17:16,140 --> 00:17:16,860
Class A!

367
00:17:17,460 --> 00:17:18,720
Don't even think about coming out!

368
00:17:25,450 --> 00:17:26,360
Not bad!

369
00:17:26,950 --> 00:17:29,020
Now try this move!

370
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,420
Let's see how you defend against this!

371
00:17:43,390 --> 00:17:43,750
Strike!

372
00:17:47,900 --> 00:17:49,149
Disturbing someone's slumber...

373
00:17:49,150 --> 00:17:50,510
is rather rude.

374
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:53,280
To dare stand in my way here...

375
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:58,440
It seems I've been dormant for far too long.

376
00:17:59,010 --> 00:18:00,400
Waking from a long slumber,

377
00:18:01,070 --> 00:18:02,070
only to find things...

378
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:02,880
so noisy.

379
00:18:03,860 --> 00:18:05,680
Since you're eager to die,

380
00:18:06,310 --> 00:18:07,010
then I'll gladly...

381
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:08,890
send you on your way.

382
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:11,770
Then, everyone here...

383
00:18:13,310 --> 00:18:15,060
will be buried.

384
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:16,860
After that,

385
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:18,760
I'll take your identity

386
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:21,710
and have some fun in the human world.

387
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:23,510
How does that sound?

388
00:18:24,580 --> 00:18:26,590
I'm afraid you won't survive today.

389
00:18:30,140 --> 00:18:31,760
The one who won't survive today...

390
00:18:32,530 --> 00:18:33,760
I wonder who that'll be.

391
00:18:41,610 --> 00:18:42,360
All clear!

392
00:18:43,060 --> 00:18:44,800
Old Man,

393
00:18:45,070 --> 00:18:48,029
have you seen Lu Shu?

394
00:18:48,030 --> 00:18:50,130
I'm looking for him.

395
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:51,560
Lu Shu?

396
00:18:52,330 --> 00:18:53,650
I saw him when we came in,

397
00:18:53,870 --> 00:18:55,150
but I have no idea where he went now.

398
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:56,300
Alright.

399
00:18:57,620 --> 00:18:58,650
I'll keep looking then.

400
00:18:59,160 --> 00:18:59,630
Sure.

401
00:19:00,210 --> 00:19:02,130
Be careful out there, Xiaoyu.

402
00:19:02,690 --> 00:19:03,140
Wait a second...

403
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:04,670
Are you two done talking?

404
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,410
Old Man,

405
00:19:08,750 --> 00:19:10,030
is that guy your fan?

406
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:11,390
He's cosplaying you!

407
00:19:13,170 --> 00:19:15,869
Aren't cosplayers supposed to copy outfits?

408
00:19:15,870 --> 00:19:18,380
First time seeing someone copy just the face!

409
00:19:18,840 --> 00:19:19,399
Hey...

410
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:20,040
Sister,

411
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,560
does this look like cosplay to you?

412
00:19:21,680 --> 00:19:23,010
There are two Class As standing right here!

413
00:19:23,150 --> 00:19:24,700
Don't you feel any pressure at all?

414
00:19:26,610 --> 00:19:27,170
Who asked you?

415
00:19:28,340 --> 00:19:30,180
I'm going back to finding Lu Shu.

416
00:19:30,880 --> 00:19:31,790
Jerk Lu Shu!

417
00:19:31,950 --> 00:19:33,150
Always running off on his own!

418
00:19:37,230 --> 00:19:38,399
Ate so many bugs,

419
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,370
and even got an Artifact Spirit!

420
00:19:39,780 --> 00:19:40,859
What a massive haul!

421
00:19:40,860 --> 00:19:41,790
Not bad at all!

422
00:19:43,040 --> 00:19:43,990
What's this place?

423
00:19:44,490 --> 00:19:45,840
A rundown shack at the end of the road...

424
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,019
There's bound to be...

425
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:47,350
treasure!

426
00:19:49,290 --> 00:19:49,920
Treasure!

427
00:19:50,570 --> 00:19:51,440
Here I come!

428
00:19:53,930 --> 00:19:54,330
Xiaoyu!

429
00:19:55,610 --> 00:19:55,840
Lu—

430
00:19:56,810 --> 00:19:57,250
Wait, no.

431
00:19:57,550 --> 00:19:59,480
How can I forgive a jerk who stood me up so easily?

432
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,219
Xiaoyu!

433
00:20:02,220 --> 00:20:02,840
Are you okay?

434
00:20:02,980 --> 00:20:03,540
Man, things over here were...

435
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:05,870
You promised to wait outside the palace for me!

436
00:20:07,280 --> 00:20:08,069
Well, you see...

437
00:20:08,070 --> 00:20:09,660
I was inside the palace,

438
00:20:09,760 --> 00:20:12,100
but who knew it'd suddenly sink down?

439
00:20:13,340 --> 00:20:13,739
The—

440
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:14,990
The Old Man here can vouch for me!

441
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,140
Really?

442
00:20:17,700 --> 00:20:18,280
Really, really!

443
00:20:18,670 --> 00:20:21,040
I was crying and begging to go up and look for you!

444
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:23,230
I sure don't remember anything like that.

445
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,990
Old Man, you...!

446
00:20:25,630 --> 00:20:27,300
Are you all pretending I don't exist?!

447
00:20:27,770 --> 00:20:28,430
Shut up!

448
00:20:30,780 --> 00:20:32,610
You guys are really...

449
00:20:33,150 --> 00:20:34,830
underestimating me...

450
00:20:35,660 --> 00:20:36,830
This guy...

451
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,270
definitely has to die!

452
00:20:49,830 --> 00:20:50,490
Got you!

453
00:20:54,870 --> 00:20:56,570
Despicable humans!

454
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:58,170
I'm going to...

455
00:20:58,270 --> 00:20:59,360
...kill you all!

456
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:09,720
We're screwed!

457
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:12,920
Lu Shu!

458
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:13,670
I know!

459
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:16,530
No need to trouble yourself!

460
00:21:18,230 --> 00:21:18,860
I'll help too!

461
00:21:20,290 --> 00:21:21,110
Hold back, Xiaoyu.

462
00:21:21,930 --> 00:21:23,680
Now isn't the right time.

463
00:21:25,670 --> 00:21:26,590
The time?

464
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:33,210
A sinister power like Soul Subjugation...

465
00:21:34,290 --> 00:21:35,280
If the Old Man finds out,

466
00:21:35,690 --> 00:21:37,280
what will he think of us?

467
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:38,930
At least for now,

468
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:43,529
we can lure as many gargoyles as possible

469
00:21:43,530 --> 00:21:44,990
away from here.

470
00:21:57,320 --> 00:21:57,970
What are you laughing at?

471
00:21:58,910 --> 00:21:59,640
Nothing.

472
00:22:00,870 --> 00:22:01,900
Seriously, what is it?

473
00:22:02,320 --> 00:22:03,480
Nothing means nothing.

474
00:22:03,580 --> 00:22:04,349
Wait, no.

475
00:22:04,350 --> 00:22:05,180
Something's definitely up.

476
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,310
It's really nothing!

477
00:22:31,390 --> 00:22:33,079
Pardon me, watch out,

478
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:35,010
'cause this mouth is coming through.

479
00:22:35,810 --> 00:22:37,519
If you caught a stray,

480
00:22:37,520 --> 00:22:39,460
well, that was purely intentional.

481
00:22:39,750 --> 00:22:40,710
Say no!

482
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:43,390
Say no!

483
00:22:44,190 --> 00:22:45,640
Say no!

484
00:22:46,410 --> 00:22:47,920
Say no!

485
00:22:49,180 --> 00:22:50,729
Lectures in every shape and form,

486
00:22:50,730 --> 00:22:52,760
yet they're all the same old crap.

487
00:22:53,560 --> 00:22:55,319
I'd advise you to fold early,

488
00:22:55,320 --> 00:22:57,670
only lousy odds saved your neck.

489
00:22:58,100 --> 00:22:59,649
If anyone's eager to take an L,

490
00:22:59,650 --> 00:23:01,410
I'll gladly do buy five, get one free.

491
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:03,219
Just don't,

492
00:23:03,220 --> 00:23:04,060
whatever you do, don't...

493
00:23:04,190 --> 00:23:06,590
hold back that resentment.

494
00:23:07,520 --> 00:23:10,720
Did you really feel wronged?

495
00:23:11,900 --> 00:23:16,700
Spill it, so I can have a good laugh.

496
00:23:18,050 --> 00:23:22,440
Greatness isn't the only way to be,

497
00:23:22,530 --> 00:23:26,850
a savior of the world or just a mere ant.

498
00:23:27,130 --> 00:23:29,100
Why build your own cage?

499
00:23:29,190 --> 00:23:35,809
Is suffering for no reason counted as a win?

500
00:23:35,810 --> 00:23:40,279
Do good or bad, someone will bash you anyway.

501
00:23:40,280 --> 00:23:43,890
Get me or not, honestly, suit yourself.

502
00:23:44,890 --> 00:23:46,880
Just chalk it up to a rebellious phase,

503
00:23:46,970 --> 00:23:53,560
one that lasts all my life.

